build/
*.o
*.so
*.a

# GOD PROMPT "CKKS PHASE 21": Graphify's knowledge-graph output. graph.json,
# GRAPH_REPORT.md, and .graphify_analysis.json ARE committed (see research/
# GRAPHIFY_GUIDE.md) -- they are small, portable (no absolute paths/machine
# info), and let a fresh clone browse the graph/report without re-running
# extraction. Everything else here is either a local absolute-path pointer,
# a timestamp-dependent cache/manifest regenerated on the next `graphify
# extract .`/`graphify update .`, or a 2MB interactive visualization nobody
# needs to diff in git -- excluded, not because the directory is unwanted,
# but because these specific files are machine-specific or disposable.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/graph.json
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
!graphify-out/.graphify_analysis.json
